# GradientBlinds - an animated gradient behind a hero: diagonal blinds and a light that follows the pointer, drawn on
# the GPU (WebGL, through `ogl`: npm i ogl). Make it the first child of the hero and it fills the hero, fading out
# at the bottom into the page; the content goes on top. colors: hex stops separated by commas.
#   Stack class("cx-hero-blinds") { GradientBlinds(colors: "#9B80FF,#6B46F2")  Stack class("…") { … } }
# shadcn-for-muten · Custom · needs ogl · host JS gradient-blinds.js.
part GradientBlinds(colors: text = "#9B80FF,#6B46F2") { Custom GradientBlinds inputs(colors: $colors) class("cx-blinds") }
